Engineered around a massive, heavily reinforced chest Arc Reactor, "Heartbreaker" was built specifically for raw firepower. Its enlarged chest transmitter allows Tony to fire devastating wide-beam Unibeams and project powerful repulsor energy shields that can blow back multiple enemies at once.

In Iron Man 3, Heartbreaker takes center stage during the climax: it acts as the flagship suit leading the Iron Legion squad into battle at the Norco oil rig. When Rhodey is trapped on a gantry without his War Machine suit, Tony orders Heartbreaker to carry Rhodey on its back across the battlefield to safety.
